%N A386863 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 2^(n-k) * binomial(3*n+1,k) * binomial(3*n-k-1,n-k).
%F A386863 a(n) = [x^n] (1+x)^(3*n+1)/(1-2*x)^(2*n).
%F A386863 a(n) = [x^n] 1/((1-x)^2 * (1-3*x)^(2*n)).
%F A386863 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 3^k * (-2)^(n-k) * (n-k+1) * binomial(3*n+1,k).
%F A386863 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 3^k * (n-k+1) * binomial(2*n+k-1,k).
%F A386863 Conjecture D-finite with recurrence 256*n*(2*n-1)*a(n) +224*(-90*n^2+197*n-120)*a(n-1) +8*(22946*n^2-84680*n+71325)*a(n-2) +18*(16798*n^2-128101*n+228655)*a(n-3) -9639*(3*n-8)*(3*n-10)*a(n-4)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
%F A386863 Conjecture D-finite with recurrence 8*n*(2*n-1)*(5*n-9)*(4*n-5)*a(n) +2*(-3280*n^4+13224*n^3-17823*n^2+9041*n-1344)*a(n-1) +9*(3*n-4)*(5*n-4)*(3*n-2)*(4*n-1)*a(n-2)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
%o A386863 (PARI) a(n) = sum(k=0, n, 2^(n-k)*binomial(3*n+1, k)*binomial(3*n-k-1, n-k));
